<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>GeoIP on Ricky</title><link>https://linzeyan.github.io/zh-tw/tags/geoip/</link><description>Recent content in GeoIP on Ricky</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-tw</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2020 15:44:48 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://linzeyan.github.io/zh-tw/tags/geoip/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>2020年，最新NGINX的ngx_http_geoip2模块以精准禁止特定国家或者地区IP访问</title><link>https://linzeyan.github.io/zh-tw/posts/2020/20201027-nginx_geoip2/</link><pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2020 15:44:48 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://linzeyan.github.io/zh-tw/posts/2020/20201027-nginx_geoip2/</guid><description>&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.cnblogs.com/faberbeta/p/nginx_geoip2.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;2020 年，最新 NGINX 的 ngx_http_geoip2 模块以精准禁止特定国家或者地区 IP 访问&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.cnblogs.com/baxiqiuxing/p/12376879.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;centos7 下 安装 GeoIP2，在 nginx 中根据 ip 地址对应的国家转发请求&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h5 id="安装-geoip2-lib"&gt;安装 geoip2 lib&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;div class="code-block" data-code-block&gt;&lt;div class="code-block-full" id="code-block-c70943bd38fa069e886fd031a1cd235e-0"&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;cd&lt;/span&gt; /usr/local/src
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;rm -f libmaxminddb-1.4.2.tar.gz
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;wget https://github.com/maxmind/libmaxminddb/releases/download/1.4.2/libmaxminddb-1.4.2.tar.gz
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;tar -xzf libmaxminddb-1.4.2.tar.gz
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;cd&lt;/span&gt; libmaxminddb-1.4.2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;yum install gcc gcc-c++ make -y
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;./configure
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;make
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;make check
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;sudo make install
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;echo&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;/usr/local/lib&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt; &amp;gt; /etc/ld.so.conf.d/geoip.conf
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;sudo ldconfig
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;script type="application/json" class="code-block-data"&gt;{"copyButton":true,"expanded":false,"labels":{"code":"Code","copied":"Copied!","copy":"Copy","copyError":"Copy failed. Try again.","showAll":"Show all {count} lines","showLess":"Show fewer lines"},"language":"","preview":"","source":"cd /usr/local/src\nrm -f libmaxminddb-1.4.2.tar.gz\nwget https://github.com/maxmind/libmaxminddb/releases/download/1.4.2/libmaxminddb-1.4.2.tar.gz\ntar -xzf libmaxminddb-1.4.2.tar.gz\ncd libmaxminddb-1.4.2\nyum install gcc gcc-c++ make -y\n./configure\nmake\nmake check\nsudo make install\n\necho '/usr/local/lib' \u003e /etc/ld.so.conf.d/geoip.conf\nsudo ldconfig\n","title":"bash"}&lt;/script&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h5 id="下载-ngx_http_geoip2_module-模块"&gt;下载 ngx_http_geoip2_module 模块&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;div class="code-block" data-code-block&gt;&lt;div class="code-block-full" id="code-block-c70943bd38fa069e886fd031a1cd235e-1"&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;cd&lt;/span&gt; /usr/local/src
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;wget https://github.com/leev/ngx_http_geoip2_module/archive/3.3.tar.gz
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;tar -xzf 3.3.tar.gz
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;mv ngx_http_geoip2_module-3.3 ngx_http_geoip2_module
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# nginx集成&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;cd&lt;/span&gt; /usr/local/src
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;wget http://nginx.org/download/nginx-1.16.1.tar.gz
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;tar -zxf nginx-1.16.1.tar.gz
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;cd&lt;/span&gt; nginx-1.16.1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;useradd -M -s /sbin/nologin www
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;yum install gcc gcc-c++ make pcre-devel zlib-devel openssl-devel -y
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;./configure --user&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;www --group&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;www --prefix&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;/usr/local/nginx &lt;span class="se"&gt;\
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;--with-ld-opt&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;-Wl,-rpath -Wl,/usr/local/lib&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="se"&gt;\
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;--with-http_sub_module &lt;span class="se"&gt;\
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;--with-http_realip_module &lt;span class="se"&gt;\
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;--with-http_gzip_static_module &lt;span class="se"&gt;\
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;--with-http_ssl_module &lt;span class="se"&gt;\
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;--with-http_v2_module &lt;span class="se"&gt;\
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;--add-module&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;/usr/local/src/ngx_http_geoip2_module
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;make
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;make install
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;script type="application/json" class="code-block-data"&gt;{"copyButton":true,"expanded":false,"labels":{"code":"Code","copied":"Copied!","copy":"Copy","copyError":"Copy failed. Try again.","showAll":"Show all {count} lines","showLess":"Show fewer lines"},"language":"","preview":"","source":"cd /usr/local/src\nwget https://github.com/leev/ngx_http_geoip2_module/archive/3.3.tar.gz\ntar -xzf 3.3.tar.gz\nmv ngx_http_geoip2_module-3.3 ngx_http_geoip2_module\n\n# nginx集成\ncd /usr/local/src\nwget http://nginx.org/download/nginx-1.16.1.tar.gz\ntar -zxf nginx-1.16.1.tar.gz\ncd nginx-1.16.1\nuseradd -M -s /sbin/nologin www\n\n\nyum install gcc gcc-c++ make pcre-devel zlib-devel openssl-devel -y\n./configure --user=www --group=www --prefix=/usr/local/nginx \\\n--with-ld-opt=\"-Wl,-rpath -Wl,/usr/local/lib\" \\\n--with-http_sub_module \\\n--with-http_realip_module \\\n--with-http_gzip_static_module \\\n--with-http_ssl_module \\\n--with-http_v2_module \\\n--add-module=/usr/local/src/ngx_http_geoip2_module\n\nmake\nmake install\n","title":"bash"}&lt;/script&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h5 id="geoip2-ip-地址库下载"&gt;geoip2 IP 地址库下载&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;p&gt;2020 年最新 GeoLite2-City.mmdb 无法直接下载，必须注册 maxmind 账号&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>